#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.2.rst:4
msgid "v3.9.2"
msgstr "v3.9.2"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.2.rst:6
msgid ""
"v3.9.2 substantially improves the **TV driver** (higher resolution, scaling,"
" triple buffering), re-enables imlib features that now fit in flash, bumps "
"the ImageIO format version, and fixes the FLIR Lepton driver, F7 LCD triple "
"buffering, and grayscale color/Y filtering. It introduces **no breaking API "
"changes** — v3.9.1 scripts run unchanged."
msgstr ""
"v3.9.2 secara substansial meningkatkan **driver TV** (resolusi lebih tinggi,"
" penskalaan, triple buffering), mengaktifkan kembali fitur imlib yang kini "
"muat dalam flash, meningkatkan versi format ImageIO, dan memperbaiki driver "
"FLIR Lepton, triple buffering LCD F7, serta filter warna dan Y skala abu-"
"abu. Ini **tidak memperkenalkan perubahan API yang merusak** — skrip v3.9.1 "
"berjalan tanpa perubahan."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.2.rst:15
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Di halaman ini"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.2.rst:18
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Sorotan"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.2.rst:20
msgid "**TV driver** — higher resolution, scaling, and triple buffering."
msgstr ""
"**Driver TV** — resolusi lebih tinggi, penskalaan, dan triple buffering."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.2.rst:21
msgid ""
"**More imlib features** re-enabled now that the extra code fits in flash."
msgstr ""
"**Lebih banyak fitur imlib** diaktifkan kembali karena kode tambahan kini "
"muat dalam flash."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.2.rst:22
msgid ""
"**Fixes** — FLIR Lepton driver (M4/M7), F7 LCD triple buffering, grayscale "
"color and Y filtering."
msgstr ""
"**Perbaikan** — driver FLIR Lepton (M4/M7), triple buffering LCD F7, filter "
"warna dan Y skala abu-abu."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.2.rst:24
msgid ""
"**No breaking API changes** — reflash and your v3.9.1 scripts run unchanged."
msgstr ""
"**Tidak ada perubahan API yang merusak** — reflash dan skrip v3.9.1 Anda "
"berjalan tanpa perubahan."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.2.rst:28
msgid "New features"
msgstr "Fitur baru"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.2.rst:30
msgid ""
"**TV driver** — improved resolution, added scaling, and added triple "
"buffering."
msgstr ""
"**Driver TV** — resolusi ditingkatkan, penskalaan ditambahkan, dan triple "
"buffering ditambahkan."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.2.rst:32
msgid ""
"Re-enabled imlib features and additional support that now fit in flash."
msgstr ""
"Fitur imlib dan dukungan tambahan yang kini muat dalam flash diaktifkan "
"kembali."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.2.rst:35
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "Perubahan dan peningkatan lainnya"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.2.rst:37
msgid ""
"Bumped the ImageIO format version; switched to RGB565 when a color table is "
"used and to fast YUV macros; renamed and tidied several examples; enabled SD"
" hardware flow control and used two stop bits for the debug UART connection."
msgstr ""
"Meningkatkan versi format ImageIO; beralih ke RGB565 saat tabel warna "
"digunakan dan ke makro YUV cepat; mengganti nama dan merapikan beberapa "
"contoh; mengaktifkan flow control hardware SD dan menggunakan dua stop bit "
"untuk koneksi UART debug."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.2.rst:42
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Perbaikan bug"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.2.rst:44
msgid "Camera and display:"
msgstr "Kamera dan tampilan:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.2.rst:46
msgid ""
"Fixed the FLIR Lepton driver on the M4 and M7, F7 LCD triple-buffering "
"issues, grayscale color and the Y filter, and DCMI de-init on sensor "
"shutdown (added DCMI MSP de-init)."
msgstr ""
"Memperbaiki driver FLIR Lepton pada M4 dan M7, masalah triple-buffering LCD "
"F7, filter warna dan Y skala abu-abu, serta de-init DCMI pada shutdown "
"sensor (menambahkan de-init MSP DCMI)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.2.rst:50
msgid "System:"
msgstr "Sistem:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.2.rst:52
msgid "Fixed an issue with an old version of pygame in the desktop tooling."
msgstr "Memperbaiki masalah dengan versi pygame lama dalam tooling desktop."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.2.rst:55
msgid "Breaking API changes"
msgstr "Perubahan API yang merusak kompatibilitas"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.2.rst:57
msgid ""
"v3.9.2 introduces **no breaking Python API changes**. Scripts that ran on "
"v3.9.1 run unchanged on v3.9.2 — just reflash the firmware."
msgstr ""
"v3.9.2 **tidak memperkenalkan perubahan API Python yang merusak**\\ . Skrip "
"yang berjalan pada v3.9.1 berjalan tanpa perubahan pada v3.9.2 — cukup "
"reflash firmware."
